---
manual: app.shoes_app
lines: [859, 863]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $inside = self
  @hello = para "Hello"
  @go = button "Go"
end
----------- test code
assert_equal 1, Shoes.APPS.size, "Shoes.app opened one app"
app = Shoes.APPS.first
assert_same app, $inside, "the block ran inside that app"
assert_equal [para("@hello").linkable_id, button("@go").linkable_id], app.document_root.contents.map(&:linkable_id),
  "the block's elements fill the window, in order"
